      "id": "idea-1",
      "title": "Automated GitHub Pull Request Webhooks for Streak Check-Ins",
      "problem": "Active student coders frequently commit code every single day on GitHub but forget manual button check-ins on the web dashboard, risking long hard-earned streaks.",
      "solution": "Add an automated GitHub webhook listener that awards daily check-in credit whenever a student pushes meaningful commits to any verified Proof-of-Build repository.",
